WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.152 --> 00:00:03.402
(upbeat holiday music)

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:09.810
- My name is Ada (indistinct),
and I'm seven and a half,

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:12.900
and I live in Charlotte, North Carolina.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:17.900
And what I want from Christmas
from Santa is another dog.

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:21.030
As you can see, I have one right here,

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:25.500
and his name is Pizza, and
I think he deserves a wife.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.224
So I'm gonna name that dog Hot Dog.

00:00:29.224 --> 00:00:30.824
Bye.

00:00:30.824 --> 00:00:32.370
(applauding)

00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:34.950
- Notice that Pizza got up
when a wife was mentioned.

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:35.940
I'm just saying.

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:38.523
I am here with Poppy Montgomery
and Linda Cardellini.

00:00:38.523 --> 00:00:41.460
(drowned out by cheering)

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:42.840
All week we have teamed up

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:45.150
with our season-long
partner Pilot Frixion Pen,

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:47.370
the go-to erasable pen of
the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:50.850
to give Santa an assist with
some Christmas wishlists.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:52.920
Try and say that five times fast.

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:54.617
It'd be different than Jack Kaufman.

00:00:54.617 --> 00:00:57.030
(laughing)

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:58.080
Nice callback.

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:00.870
That was seven-year-old Ada who wants

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:02.580
to find a wife for her dog Pizza.

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:04.410
Pizza seemed excited about it.

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:07.260
Ada, we want to celebrate
kids like you who create fun

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:09.810
and ambitious gift lists so fearlessly.

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:12.360
And we think pizza also
deserves a wife, as well.

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:14.670
So we're giving you a thousand dollars

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:18.710
to help you get a second
dog and take care of her.

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:21.720
Merry Christmas and sorry, parents,

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.450
if you didn't want that
to happen (laughs).

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:26.340
And everyone watching,
remember you can pick up

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:27.720
Pilot Frixion Erasable Pens

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:29.130
wherever office supplies are sold.

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:31.080
They're rad, you'll want 'em, trust me.

